graph TB
    Ticket(["<b>Incoming Ticket</b><br/>Email / Chat / Web form"])

    Triage["<b>Triage Agent</b> (Haiku)<br/><br/><b>Tools:</b><br/>- CRM lookup<br/>- Ticket System (read)<br/><br/><b>Does:</b><br/>- Urgency, type, complexity<br/>- Customer tier<br/>- Sets SLA deadline"]

    Technical["<b>Technical Agent</b> (Sonnet)<br/><br/><b>Tools:</b><br/>- Logs / monitoring<br/>- Status page<br/>- Product docs<br/><br/><b>Does:</b><br/>- Root-cause hypothesis<br/>- Drafts fix<br/><i>Only if technical</i>"]
    Billing["<b>Billing Agent</b> (Haiku)<br/><br/><b>Tools:</b><br/>- Billing API (read-only)<br/>- Policy docs<br/><br/><b>Does:</b><br/>- Invoices, payments<br/>- Refund eligibility<br/><i>Only if billing</i>"]
    KB["<b>Knowledge Base Agent</b> (Haiku)<br/><br/><b>Tools:</b><br/>- KB semantic search<br/>- Resolved tickets<br/><br/><b>Does:</b><br/>- Similar solved issues<br/>- Draft reply + confidence<br/><i>Always runs</i>"]

    Routing["<b>Routing Agent</b> (Sonnet)<br/><br/><b>Tools:</b><br/>- Ticket System (write)<br/>- Team queues<br/>- Email / chat send<br/><br/><b>Does:</b><br/>- Merges all analysis<br/>- Picks final destination<br/>- Writes context summary"]

    Auto["<b>Auto-response</b><br/>~40%"]
    Human["<b>Human Team</b><br/>~55%<br/>Engineering / Finance / L1"]
    Escalate["<b>Escalation</b><br/>~5%<br/>Team lead / manager"]

    SLA["<b>Escalation Agent</b> (Haiku)<br/><br/><b>Tools:</b><br/>- Ticket System<br/>- Slack / email alerts<br/><br/><b>Does:</b><br/>- Background SLA monitor<br/>- Runs every ~5 min<br/>- Alerts when time is low"]

    Ticket --> Triage
    Triage -.->|parallel| Technical
    Triage -.->|parallel| Billing
    Triage -.->|parallel| KB
    Technical --> Routing
    Billing --> Routing
    KB --> Routing
    Routing --> Auto
    Routing --> Human
    Routing --> Escalate
    SLA -.->|monitors open tickets| Routing
    SLA -.->|SLA at risk| Escalate

